<item><title>Coffee Quality Business buys Bukinanyana coffee and employs 110</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/coffee-quality-business-buys-bukinanyana-coffee-and-employs-aca5e3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/coffee-quality-business-buys-bukinanyana-coffee-and-employs-aca5e3/</guid><category>Burundi</category><description>Raphaël Yaminyibuka bought a local association and its coffee stock after returning to Burundi in 2023 with 25 million Burundian francs.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 05:31:52 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/coffee-quality-business-buys-bukinanyana-coffee-and-employs-aca5e3/share.jpg" length="43194" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/coffee-quality-business-buys-bukinanyana-coffee-and-employs-aca5e3/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
